v 3
d CONSORT-like flowchart
d The consort command provides a simple way to build a vertical flowchart, or a CONSORT-like flow diagram.
d All diagram nodes are added step-by-step, and the user has full control over the contents of the data presented.
d The flowchart is created as a standard Stata graph, and can be exported in any appropriate format.
d The default output can be modified by added arrows and plots (e.g. for textboxes).
d 
d Program by Barna Szabó-Söderberg
p consort Flexible production of vertical flowcharts and CONSORT-like flow diagrams.
